{
  "_comment": "DEMO DATA. Inicio per user. help = neutral contextual text (no «tu/tus»); personal wording only in actions. alert replaces help. myTrip = the MOST RECENT trip/request only and ALWAYS carries the 4 canonical stages (shared JourneyProgress); stages[].state = done | current | todo | na («No aplica»: the stage keeps its number and position, gray — Anticipo for perfil Director with personnelGroup E/ED — DGA does not inherit the rule). summary or summaries[] (several blocks in order); each block has scope: personal · operational · organizational. ORGANIZATIONAL BUDGET block = Planeado · Ejercido · Comprometido · PRE disponible, with PRE disponible = Planeado − Comprometido (Ejercido = consumed part of Comprometido; it does not change the formula). kpi.valueTone = true paints the value in the tone color (Nivel de rechazos % in red — no threshold rule). trays[].columns = personal · externos · standard · operational · operationalOrg · hosted · traveling · bitacora (docs/TABLE_LIST_STANDARD.md); trays[].detalleMeaning states what Detalle holds in that table (same meaning for every row); trays[].filters = contextual filters (status · org · perfil); trays[].pageSize (default 5). rows[].status = key in statuses.json. Folio rule: prose says «folio 000nn»; a FOLIO column cell holds the number only («—» when the record has none). Canonical scope reference per role: docs/HOME_VISIBILITY_MATRIX.md.",
